  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Effective rule of law frameworks</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project promotes and strengthens the rule of law at national and international levels by: (a) promoting the implementation n of the Latimer House Principles; (b) strengthening legislative drafting and law reform capacity; (c) establishing of a Commonwealth Pro Bono Centre to enable Qualifying Commonwealth Countries to access free legal services from international law firms in support of their efforts to realise their SDG targets ; and (d) promoting law reform to end discrimination against women and girls and other vulnerable persons.??</narrative>
  </description>
